# ── Bot defence (Cloudflare Turnstile) ─────────────────────────────────────
# 1. https://dash.cloudflare.com → Turnstile → "Add site"
#    - Domain: lead-stream-vert.vercel.app  (add localhost for dev)
#    - Widget mode: Managed
# 2. Copy "Site key"   → NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY
# 3. Copy "Secret key" → TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY (server-only)
